<title>UK: BFI unchanged at 1,259, halts 5-1/2 week decline.</title>
<headline>BFI unchanged at 1,259, halts 5-1/2 week decline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spot Baltic Freight Index (BFI) was unchanged on Wednesday at 1,259, having fallen without interruption since March 24 from 1,526.</p>
<p>Brokers reported steadier conditions for Panamaxes, but demand for Capers and Handysizes remained subdued.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom 44 171 542 8080</p>
